    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="8b60689d-a10d-5831-a691-c692470bb263" activityNameId="bfdfa44e-7ea9-5ed0-85b1-090e37f60c6f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, treatment of CRT glass</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, treatment of CRT glass
The multioutput-process "treatment CRT glass" delivers the co-products "disposal, treatment of CRT glass”, "glass cullets, panel glass, for CRT glass production, at plant", "glass cullets, funnel glass, for CRT glass production, at plant" and "glass cullets, mixed glass, for CRT glass production, at plant". The allocation is done 100% to the disposal process.;
UUID: 42db73c9-dd58-4089-bbbe-50f6cce3855f
This dataset represents the treatment of CRT tubes. It includes infrastructure, energy consumption, water consumption and an estimation of the efforts for transportation. The process has no emissions to air / water.
Location: Data from a Swiss CRT glass treatment company - used as global average data.
Technology: Modern, up-to-date CRT treatment plant – with crushing, washing and sorting steps.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company information &amp; own estimation 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_42db73c9-dd58-4089-bbbe-50f6cce3855f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
